00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:34.874
LAST FRIDAY, A SELF-IMPOSED

00:00:33.005 --> 00:00:36.542
DEADLINE BY KELLY, A NUMBER OF

00:00:35.007 --> 00:00:38.544
