00:00:36.675 --> 00:00:39.612
CLEARANCE IS INCLUDING JARED

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:41.413
KUSHNER.

00:00:39.745 --> 00:00:43.582
THE INVESTIGATION INTO HIS

00:00:41.547 --> 00:00:44.283
SECURITY CLEARANCE STILL NOT

00:00:43.716 --> 00:00:50.823
COMPLETED, FIRST SON-IN-LAW

00:00:44.416 --> 00:00:51.423
JARED KUSHNER HAD HIS CLEARANCE

00:00:50.956 --> 00:00:52.625
DOWNGRADED.

00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:54.126
WHILE KUSHNER CAN VIEW SOME

00:00:52.758 --> 00:00:55.861
CLASSIFIED INFORMATION, HE

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.529
CANNOT LONGER SEE THE MOST

00:00:55.995 --> 00:01:01.033
SENSITIVE ITEMS, LIKE THE

00:00:56.662 --> 00:01:03.602
PRESIDENT'S DAILY BRIEF.

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:05.237
ASKED ABOUT THE DOWNGRADE,

00:01:03.736 --> 00:01:06.839
PRESIDENT TRUMP WOULDN'T ANSWER.

00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:07.673
LAST WEEK, THE PRESIDENT SAID HE

00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:11.644
WOULD LEAVE IT TO HIS CHIEF OF

00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:12.611
STAFF TO DECIDE WHAT TO DO ABOUT

00:01:11.777 --> 00:01:15.447
KUSHNER'S SECURITY CLEARANCE.

00:01:12.745 --> 00:01:16.015
&gt;&gt; THAT WILL BE AFTER

00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:18.050
GENERAL KELLY.

00:01:16.148 --> 00:01:20.853
GENERAL KELLY RESPECTS JARED A

00:01:18.184 --> 00:01:22.421
LOT AND WILL MAKE THE CALL.

00:01:20.986 --> 00:01:23.255
&gt;&gt; THE DOWNGRADE IS NOT EXPECTED

00:01:22.555 --> 00:01:27.660
TO AFFECT THE WORK ON POLICY IN

00:01:23.389 --> 00:01:29.361
THE MIDDLE EAST PEACE PROCESS.

00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:30.863
A SPOKESPERSON FOR KUSHNER

00:01:29.495 --> 00:01:31.864
SAYING "MR. KUSHNER HAS DONE

00:01:30.996 --> 00:01:34.633
MORE THAN WHAT IS EXPECTED OF

00:01:31.997 --> 00:01:35.334
HIM IN THIS PROCESS.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:38.437
THOSE INVOLVED HAVE CONFIRMED

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:39.839
THERE ARE DOZENS OF PEOPLE AT

00:01:38.571 --> 00:01:41.440
MR. KUSHNER'S LEVEL WHOSE

00:01:39.972 --> 00:01:43.742
PROCESS IS DELAYED.

00:01:41.574 --> 00:01:45.477
NO CONCERNS WERE RAISED ABOUT

00:01:43.876 --> 00:01:46.245
MR. KUSHNER'S APPLICATION."

00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:47.246
DEPUTY ATTORNEY GENERAL ROD

00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:48.480
ROSENSTEIN INFORMED THE

00:01:47.379 --> 00:01:49.548
WHITE HOUSE THREE WEEKS AGO THAT

00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:54.653
THERE WERE STILL A NUMBER OF

00:01:49.682 --> 00:01:55.654
ITEMS IN KUSHNER'S FILE THAT

00:01:54.787 --> 00:01:57.857
REQUIRE FURTHER INVESTIGATION.

00:01:55.788 --> 00:01:59.458
NOT KNOWN WHEN THE PROCESS WILL

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:01.760
BE COMPLETED OR WHETHER KUSHNER

00:01:59.592 --> 00:02:03.829
WILL RECEIVE HIS FULL SECURITY

00:02:01.894 --> 00:02:05.364
CLEARANCE.

00:02:03.963 --> 00:02:07.833
THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE

00:02:05.497 --> 00:02:09.668
WEIGHED IN ON PRESIDENT TRUMP'S

00:02:07.967 --> 00:02:11.837
