00:02:13.772 --> 00:02:17.443
IT CAN BE DONE WITHOUT GOING

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:19.612
THROUGH CONGRESS.

00:02:17.576 --> 00:02:20.579
&gt;&gt; OUR TOP PEOPLE IN THE

00:02:19.745 --> 00:02:23.916
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE HAVE

00:02:20.713 --> 00:02:27.853
BELIEVED FOR SOME TIME THAT

00:02:24.049 --> 00:02:30.689
THROUGH REGULATORY PROCESS WE

00:02:27.987 --> 00:02:32.591
CANNOT ALLOW THE BUMP STOCK TO

00:02:30.823 --> 00:02:34.526
CONVERT A WEAPON FROM

00:02:32.725 --> 00:02:34.894
SEMIAUTOMATIC TO FULLY

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.229
AUTOMATIC.

00:02:35.027 --> 00:02:38.631
&gt;&gt; ON THE BROADER ISSUE OF GUN

00:02:37.363 --> 00:02:40.165
SAFETY AND SCHOOL SHOOTINGS, THE

00:02:38.764 --> 00:02:41.734
WHITE HOUSE TODAY SAID IT WILL

00:02:40.299 --> 00:02:43.669
