00:02:41.867 --> 00:02:45.037
ANNOUNCE LATER THIS WEEK.

00:02:43.802 --> 00:02:46.071
ONE QUESTION, WHILE THE

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.173
PRESIDENT MAKE GOOD ON HIS

00:02:46.205 --> 00:02:50.476
