00:02:50.609 --> 00:02:54.713
TO DO IT, HE WOULD HAVE TO GO UP

00:02:53.078 --> 00:02:56.815
AGAINST THE NRA WHICH IS

00:02:54.847 --> 00:02:59.218
STRIDENTLY OPPOSED TO THE IDEA.

00:02:56.949 --> 00:02:59.885
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT SAID YESTERDAY

00:02:59.351 --> 00:03:00.452
SOMETIMES YOU HAVE TO FIGHT

00:03:00.019 --> 00:03:03.489
THEM.

00:03:00.586 --> 00:03:03.222
IS HE WILLING TO TAKE ON THE NRA

00:03:03.222 --> 00:03:04.089
IS HE WILLING TO TAKE ON THE NR

00:03:03.622 --> 00:03:06.859
NRA?

00:03:04.223 --> 00:03:07.259
THIS IDEA OF RAISING THE MINIMUM

00:03:06.992 --> 00:03:09.228
AGE.

