00:03:18.203 --> 00:03:20.272
DISCUSSION.

00:03:19.204 --> 00:03:20.806
HE KNOWS EVERYBODY DOESN'T

00:03:20.406 --> 00:03:23.909
NECESSARILY AGREE.

